00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,370
Who is old man in story?

2
00:00:08,370 --> 00:00:15,110
That is Buddha (immortal).

3
00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:27,040
Why did old man give woodcutter golden axe blade and silver axe blade?

4
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:32,770
Because it is gift for honest, truthful people.

